sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Donor as Usuario donante
    participant Web as client-web (Blazor)
    participant PayPalJS as PayPal JS SDK
    participant GW as API Gateway (YARP)
    participant Core as server-core
    participant SQL as SQL Server
    participant PayPal as PayPal Sandbox

    Note over Donor,PayPal: Donativo electronico - aprobar y capturar pago

    Donor->>PayPalJS: Aprueba el pago en Sandbox
    PayPalJS-->>Web: onApprove(orderID)
    Web->>GW: POST /api/projects/{id}/donations/paypal/capture (orderId, Bearer JWT)
    GW->>Core: Proxy a server-core
    Core->>SQL: SELECT Donation por PayPalOrderId
    Core->>Core: Valida proyecto y usuario donante
    Core->>PayPal: POST /v1/oauth2/token
    PayPal-->>Core: access_token sandbox
    Core->>PayPal: POST /v2/checkout/orders/{orderId}/capture
    alt Captura completada
        PayPal-->>Core: status COMPLETED, captureId
        Core->>SQL: UPDATE Donation status=Captured, captureId, capturedAt
        Core-->>GW: 200 donation capturada
        GW-->>Web: 200 donation capturada
        Web-->>Donor: Muestra confirmacion del donativo
    else Captura cancelada o fallida
        PayPal-->>Core: status distinto de COMPLETED o error HTTP
        Core->>SQL: UPDATE Donation status=Failed cuando hay respuesta valida
        Core-->>GW: 400/500 error tipado
        GW-->>Web: error
        Web-->>Donor: Muestra mensaje de cancelacion o fallo
    end
